---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Home" description="Null Route Queen — networking, Linux, CCNP, firewall notes, and side quests.">
<p class="eyebrow hero-terminal"><span aria-hidden="true">&gt; </span>hello world / null route engaged</p>

			<h1>Null Route Queen</h1>

			<p class="hero-status">
				<span>Fedora online</span><span aria-hidden="true"> • </span>
				<span>CCNP in progress</span><span aria-hidden="true"> • </span>
				<span>side quest probability: high</span>
			</p>

			<p class="tagline">Networking • Linux • CCNP • Side Quests</p>

			<p class="intro">
				A personal technical corner for networking, Linux, CCNP study,
				firewall notes, infrastructure war stories, and whatever side quest
				refuses to stay in its lane.
			</p>

			<aside class="card tinkering" aria-labelledby="tinkering-title">
				<h2 id="tinkering-title">Currently tinkering with</h2>
				<p>CCNP labs, Fedora fine-tuning, and a few homelab ideas waiting their turn.</p>
			</aside>

			<section class="grid" aria-label="Explore the site">
				<a class="card card-link" href="/network-lab/">
					<h2>Network Lab</h2>
					<p>WAN topology, routing, packet captures, and things that should have converged by now.</p>
				</a>

				<a class="card card-link" href="/firewall-notes/">
					<h2>Firewall Notes</h2>
					<p>Palo Alto, policy design, least privilege, logs, and the occasional mystery vendor IP.</p>
				</a>

				<a class="card card-link" href="/ccnp-journey/">
					<h2>CCNP Journey</h2>
					<p>STP, MST, routing, labs, and the evolving doctrine that BPDU = toast.</p>
				</a>

				<a class="card card-link" href="/linux-builds/">
					<h2>Linux + Builds</h2>
					<p>Fedora, hardware, homelab ideas, security keys, and projects that get slightly out of hand.</p>
				</a>

				<a class="card card-link" href="/side-quests/">
					<h2>Side Quests</h2>
					<p>Gaming, weird experiments, and whatever rabbit hole wins today.</p>
				</a>
			</section>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
	.hero-terminal {
		font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace;
		color: #99cfc8;
	}

	.hero-terminal span {
		color: #b8a5e3;
	}

	.hero-status {
		margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
		max-width: 720px;
		color: #a1a1aa;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
		text-wrap: pretty;
	}

	.hero-status span:not([aria-hidden]) {
		display: inline-block;
	}

	.tinkering {
		max-width: 720px;
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}
</style>
